# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is git-ignored; this file is committed and
# must never hold a real value — it exists to say which names are needed.
#
# Both are also set in the Vercel project's environment variables. Without
# them the site still builds and runs; the two features below degrade rather
# than break.

# Scout, the chat assistant. Google AI Studio key, read by src/pages/api/chat.ts.
# Missing -> the assistant answers "not configured yet" and nothing else.
GOOGLE_API_KEY=

# Scout's voice mode needs no key at all. src/pages/api/speak.ts uses Edge TTS,
# which reaches Microsoft's neural voices over the same websocket Edge's Read
# Aloud uses — no account, no card, nothing to configure. If it ever stops
# working the route returns 502 and the browser's own speech synthesiser takes
# over, so the site keeps talking either way.
